e need BHLL or equivalent.\n\\\" 2>&1\n\"","aggregated_output":"v1 (reshape+permute): 42.667 ms\nv2 (einsum): 59.045 ms\nv3 (stacked): 50.410 ms\nq diff: 0.000000e+00\nk diff: 0.000000e+00\nv diff: 0.000000e+00\nlogits diff: 0.000000e+00\nlogits via permute+matmul: 3.767 ms\nlogits via einsum: 3.796 ms\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
